<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>4 Wheeler</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Yuno Miles, yunomarr</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">4 Wheeler</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4gTKi7h9NoZFqwuiZa3F7c</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.130" end="00:15.940" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Jacques just want a drink)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.940" end="00:18.830" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.830" end="00:21.480">My grandma just called me a fuckin' nigga</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.480" end="00:24.150">I don't know why she mad, so I had to hit her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.150" end="00:26.890">Why the fuck my cousin looking for his four wheeler?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.890" end="00:29.340">I just need some fucking water and some sugar</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.340" end="00:32.190">How you don't got no tissue in here?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.190" end="00:34.670">Why your car only go to the first gear?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.670" end="00:37.380">Feel like DC Young Fly, bring that ass here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.380" end="00:39.880">Why you got the water, but it's not crystal clear?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.880" end="00:42.300">Sold my brother a dog, but it was a deer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.300" end="00:45.330">My momma got mad, and she said, "You bitch"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.330" end="00:47.970">That shit hurt bro, now I gotta take your tire</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.970" end="00:50.660">Why my boss look like the dude from The Wire?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.660" end="00:53.060">Why my cousin take Viagra, he horny?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.060" end="00:55.910">It's seven in the morning, tell me why my grandma snoring</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.910" end="00:58.440">I tried to rhyme orange with door hinge</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.440" end="01:01.120">I just woke up, and I just ran off my neighbor</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.120" end="01:03.870">That nigga so broke, he don't get no paper</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.870" end="01:06.310">My neighbor asked me for his money back, nigga, never</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.310" end="01:08.950">It's a hundred degrees outside, why you got a sweater?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.950" end="01:11.590">My grandma freezing, I just took her sweater</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.590" end="01:14.230">And I just went off on my barber and got a free taper</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.230" end="01:16.790">I just went off on my granddad and took his Weed wacker</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.790" end="01:19.860">I know my grandma mad at me, but still, fuck her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.860" end="01:22.340">I always run off on my family, yeah, they some suckers</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.340" end="01:26.340" /></div></body></tt>